// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2029002032" "Right.  We'll work with you, but that's as far as this partnership goes."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2116317361" "Fine.  Let's work together.  Keep it on the up and up."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3019893558" "The streets are our main priority.  Keeping them safe is key.  We work together."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1151869201" "Partnership in action as of now!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
