// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4048107256" "Fine.  Whatever."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2177081216" "I know.  City is priority number one."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1583410357" "We'll make it work."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P666028132" "I'm with you, Longbow!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_COLLABORATE_WYVERN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3695747102" "I'm on it!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2826010938" "Right.  You know what needs to get done."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2319232811" "You understand what's expected of this operation?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P994569462" "Discretion is the key here."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2771760654" "Right.  You're aware of your orders, I take it?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3728776995" "We'll discuss this later!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2363498143" "Enough!  We're not alone."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1433600912" "Shh!  We're not alone."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_FC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2471687087" "Meet later.  We'll discuss this then."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2218250134" "We'll make our presence felt in the evenings.  You guys push days."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3014764658" "Right.  We'll work in tandem with Wyvern.  We'll clean up this place."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2579935520" "We're on it."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4158499225" "You can count on the Legacy Chain."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P649221893" "Talk later!  Fight now!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4141867577" "Operation begins now!  Let's take them out."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_DISCREETOPS_LEGACY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P980552859" "Come on, people, the action just started!"

// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4208808223" "You're not getting past."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3446979977" "I don't think so."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2640017561" "Nope!  Not getting by!"
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3466487089" "You're not getting through!"
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1140895261" "Oh, I don't think so!"

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1671575908" "Yes, sir.  We managed to track him down and subdue him."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1767544714" "We'll have the test subject transported within the hour."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3946156275" "He must have escaped from Agincourt.  How would you like me to proceed, sir?"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1301165337" "Where did this guy come from??"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3133933549" "Sir, you're not going to believe what we just caught."

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1264284226" "Don't let it escape!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3533569559" "Contain the threat at all costs!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ESCAPEDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1154407478" "Incoming!  Don't let them near the subject!"

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3808621195" "Agincourt's a hotbed of activity.  You need to remain sharp at all times."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1719245098" "This is the lifeline.  From here you'll feed out across Nerva."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P382724474" "Everyone, keep in contact with your superiors.  We need to know what's going on at all times."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2588385450" "Yes, we have an informal arrangement with Wyvern and the Legacy Chain.  You will have contact with them."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3361905420" "Keep safe, people."

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2806136780" "Dismissed!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1318723839" "Carpe diem, Longbow!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3868978757" "This is not a drill!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1409913637" "You have your orders!  Let's go!"

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4174235122" "Up the bend a little further, then head back to Agincourt base."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3384708314" "Previous patrols have reported a lot of Coralax activity nearby."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3018217499" "No one gets into the base.  This patrol is crucial."
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2001664134" "A few more circuits and then we'll move over to the other side of the island."

// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P218551125" "I see bad guys!"
// NERVA_AGINCOURT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2790939636" "Protect Agincourt!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P419288753" "These streets get nastier and nastier every day."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2859606457" "Crimson sure lives up to its name.  This place is bathed in bad guys."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1265623241" "A few more circuits, then let's head across to another island."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3572341005" "Up ahead.  I see activity.  Let's check it out."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1896362707" "Protect Crimson citizens!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2716100854" "More villain wannabes!  Don't they ever quit?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2759909768" "Ok, let's do this!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1571929692" "Not a drill!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P39627989" "I got him, sir."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1394314236" "Don't move!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3836558423" "You're caught!  Face it!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2885203269" "One false move and pain is going to rain down upon you!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3933267666" "Not you again!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2881698990" "Control!  I have hostile activity!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2512318997" "I'm going to plan B!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_AERIALSPOTLIGHT_CHASER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P901939674" "Change of plans!"

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_FREEDOMCREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1064187032" "Whoa!  More incoming!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_FREEDOMCREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3281989508" "Stay together, people!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_FREEDOMCREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1840146028" "Shoulder to shoulder, take these guys on!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_FREEDOMCREY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P767284149" "Watch yourself!  More action coming our way!"

// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3921787835" "This Fort is heavily protected, sir."
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P993543199" "This isn't going to be pretty."
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2558130236" "Wow, this is going to be a tough patrol."
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P920266304" "I'm going to go around for another pass, sir."
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P123341745" "I got your wing.  Let's go around again."
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1172367582" "If someone so much as moves in your direction, shoot them."

// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1057948586" "We got bad guys!"
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4266842852" "Sir!  We're going in!  Over and out!"
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3476139396" "Come on, Longbow!  This is it!"
// MERCY_FORT_AIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3550449289" "We stick together!"

// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1368452273" "We can't go three steps without running into Arachnos.  This shift will go by quick."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3550200048" "I hate this place.  It reeks of Recluse."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2515679945" "Let's stick together.  This is going to get hairy."

// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2521991508" "Here we go!  I got your back!"
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"

// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4122074947" "It's a mess down there."
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P785535189" "This doesn't look good."
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2737134359" "The place is crawling with Arachnos.  Pardon my pun."
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2568128436" "Air patrol, you getting this?"
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1238736926" "Air patrol, you need to make a pass over here."
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1407463672" "Mark my coordinates.  There's trouble brewing."

// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P483343819" "Unfriendlies incoming!"
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3691350259" "Corps!  I'm taking hits!"
// MERCY_FORT_AERIALSEARCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P745025182" "I need assistance!  Patrols, quick!"

// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1314374315" "This place never sleeps. Be ready for anything."
// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3387662606" "It may seem quiet now. Just you wait."
// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2389363663" "I'm telling you, you relax your guard, that's when everything falls apart."

// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1456467750" "See? What'd I tell you?"
// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1490561203" "Like I said! You got to be ready!"
// WARBURG_LMAP_ARMSCROSSED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3781468485" "Am I right, or am I right?"

// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P236734941" "I've been on the Rogue Isles detail for a few months now.  It's pretty tough."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2926967713" "Nerva is crazy.  Everywhere you turn, some new faction is trying to take control."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1338807531" "Have you been out to Thorn Isle yet?  Don't go without back up.  I made that mistake."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3043602077" "Crey and Arachnos are fighting it out on Primeva.  Now that would be an exciting detail."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P315250793" "I'll be shifting to another island for patrol duty later on this week."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1050906874" "Lord Recluse's men are crazy.  C-r-a-z-y."
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3290944174" "I'm heading back to Primeva after this detail is finished."

// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P130829014" "I got your back!"
// NERVA_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3648980258" "Don't let them break us apart!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1213732804" "I found one!  Clean up the streets!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P494834575" "Back to the gutter, vermin!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3928333914" "You are a blight on society!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1991926129" "You are an embarrassment to humanity!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3292461631" "I hate punks like you!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4207660410" "Being evil is NOT cool!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P519906527" "Yeah, they're all punks.  Every last one of them.  <em=none> Shhh...I see one coming now."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2119050337" "Lowest of the low.  Scum.  <em=none> Shh...here's one."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1495460336" "They give humanity a bad name, you know?  <em=none> Shhh...I see one."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1565269096" "Human filth.  That's all they are.  I love my job.  I'd take out every last one if I could. <em=none> Hold on.  I hear something."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1746630016" "We are seriously outnumbered by scum here, but I'll take out as many as I can before I go down."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2932664991" "These guys are like vermin, they just keep coming back.  <em=none> Shhh...I hear something."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P305291325" "It's like they can't make it in the real world being decent so they go bad.  Whatever.  I have no sympathy for them."
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2148622409" "They're just evil.  That's it.  Just evil.  We need to stamp them out.  <em=none> Shhh...hear that?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_AMBUSH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3544485583" "Shh.  This is a quiet op.  We don't want a lot of attention."

// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1628178332" "Yeah, they're all punks.  Every last one of them."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P453950847" "Lowest of the low.  Scum."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983381824" "They give humanity a bad name, you know?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4065375847" "I love my job.  I'd take out every last one if I could. <em=none> Hold on.  I hear something."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4065300256" "These guys are like vermin, they just keep coming back."
// MERCY_DARWIN_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2196886526" "They're just evil.  That's it.  Just evil.  We need to stamp them out."

// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2039532876" "Man, Arachnos has some high walls.  Without air support, I have no idea how we'll get up there."
// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3434093551" "Man, heavily protected.  We're like fish in a barrel down here."
// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1570156989" "You're sure?  No air support?  This is gonna be tough.  We need to get in that Fort!"

// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1928383438" "Whoa!  Wait!  We got company!"
// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P629009720" "Okay, we're not secure down here, people!"
// MERCY_FORT_SEARCHUPFLASHLIGHTNIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2972972012" "Ack!  We got unfriendlies down here, too!"

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3063739203" "The key to Ghost Widow's operation is in that tower. We need to get up there."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3462476039" "Have you seen the bots they got up there?  This is going to be tough."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2674039440" "I wish we had some air support.  This would be a lot easier."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1969043497" "Just ignore the Infected unless they attack you.  Our goal is to get into the Fort."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3779439368" "I have no idea how we're going to get in there.  I can't get within a hundred feet of those Arbiter Drones."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1569984362" "Our position down here is precarious at best.  We're like fish in a barrel down here."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1287857820" "We NEED to get in there.  We have a mission to do."

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2410598268" "Whoa!  Watch out!"
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_ALERT_TEXT :
"P970272853" "Where did you come from?"
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1618636684" "Hey, behind you!"
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_PLOTMASTERMIND_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3207753614" "Look out!  We got company!"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1563757270" "Begin Phase 2!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1516659278" "Bring them down hard!"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1621001270" "I've heard our Ballista are the best of the best, and no single person can defeat them!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2078839463" "You hear about the time that one Ballista took out 15 wannabes?"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2389127852" "When is the Ballista's next slaughter supposed to be?"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1441943435" "I'll prove that I can be the next Ballista!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1601079067" "You are nothing to us, now leave!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_1_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P363865355" "Bring down the scum!"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2921259058" "Yeah, but their egos are huge."
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3123407009" "Hear about it, I was there! I mean... I was the CO in that sector that day..."
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P226237221" "Shhh! That's classified information!"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P122213841" "Sector compromised, begin defense procedure!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2783107482" "Tear them apart!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_BALLISTABRAG_2_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3515560657" "He has heard our conversation, do not let him leave!"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHBAIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1604748714" "This point is secure while I'm here."
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHBAIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3849129531" "No one can defeat me!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_AMBUSHBAIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3980778195" "You! You have the guts to stand up to me?"

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2383845817" "Remember, once they step out of the Arachnos base, they are open season."
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011284058" "Send Ballista to Alpha Sector ASAP."
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1410563325" "I've spotted increased Arachnos activity, stay alert."

// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P782451532" "I'd leave now, if I were you!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1053141125" "You picked a bad day to fight!"
// STMARTIAL_LONGBOW_CALLINGORDERS_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P976525442" "HQ, I'm under attack!"

// PORTALCORP_ATTACK_FREEDOMCORP_LEADER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1616340544" "Protect the Portal Corporation! Arachnos must be stopped at all cost!"
// PORTALCORP_ATTACK_FREEDOMCORP_LEADER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3725538674" "Stop them!"
// PORTALCORP_ATTACK_FREEDOMCORP_LEADER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P373015304" "Incoming! Fire at will!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3743520029" "Look, I'm just going to sit here until some Arachnos trip over you.   Shouldn't take too long since this is YOUR city."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3739714543" "Dangerous?  Probably.  Worth it?  Definitely.  Don't move."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4045787518" "Well now look at what I have here.  A banner day, yes sir."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3255020325" "Don't move unless you want some pain."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P660095210" "I'm not running away because I'm scared!  I'm just getting some friends so they can watch me own you!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1134163722" "You have no idea what you just tried to do!  There's going to be nothing left!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P123492666" "Nice try, Corps!  You lose!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2620418423" "We've got some Arachnos here.  We'll bring them in shortly.  Over."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P919360936" "I have detained some Arachnos.  Awaiting further instruction."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3144232524" "Yes, sir.  I have an Arachnos soldier detained right here.  Awaiting orders."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2490323839" "Would you like me to arrange transport?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3017658333" "I have an Arachnos soldier detained.  Awaiting pickup.  Yes, sir.  I'm in The Gutter."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3398470445" "Base!  We've been discovered!  End transmission!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3577119675" "Base!  Send reinforcements!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3980254961" "Situation just got hot!  Over and out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P961944668" "We got more incoming!  Let's go!"





// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2853524358" "You best keep alert.  Turn at the wrong time and my blade will find you."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3327833565" "You're making a big mistake."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P463902531" "I will find you."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1387467451" "You are now a walking corpse."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2441017772" "If I get away, and you know I will, you need to be very careful from now on."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2732592338" "We'll see each other again very soon."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1164870891" "You best sleep with one eye open from now on."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2275894638" "I will have my revenge, Corps!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2578195595" "I will be returning to you very shortly!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903188607" "Base.  We have some Knives of Artemis here.  Yes.  I'll bring them in for questioning."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3975831344" "Yes, sir.  I have some Artemis right here.  How would you like to arrange transport?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4242630614" "Yes, they're detained.  Please send transport."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2623993976" "Yes, sir.  We have some detained here.  How do you want to arrange transport?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3829745638" "Base!  We've been discovered!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3273739503" "Send reinforcements!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1831250676" "You will not jeopardize this operation!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1267801360" "You will not ruin this assignment!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2506976501" "You again!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTARTEMIS_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1812770355" "Yes, sir.  We have the Artemis prisoners here in the Gutter."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3386639637" "You will rue this day very very soon.  A Nemesis soldier does not forget."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3702438875" "You have made an egregious error in judgment."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3507702847" "Your death will serve as a warning to others who trifle with Nemesis.  Just you wait."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1098110352" "I will be back and you shall bleed!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P1042085948" "On my honour, your death will be long and torturous!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P574898309" "You have my word that vengeance will be mine!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2897188267" "Base.  We have some Nemesis here.  Yes.  I'll bring them in for questioning."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ABDUCTNEMESIS_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
