// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P99036364" "I'm Arachnos.  Do you seriously think I'm going to tell you anything?  Lord Recluse will kill me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1308317724" "You don't seriously think you'll be able to get any information out of me, do you?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1851591432" "If I say ONE WORD about Arachnos, Lord Recluse will have me extinguished.  Do your worst.  I'm not talking."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P405226327" "Told you I wouldn't squeal!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2682136493" "You're in BIG trouble now!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2922478993" "You are so dead!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1575358897" "We're interrogating them now, sir.  I'll let you know when we have something."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P864364159" "Yes, sir.  Interrogation is in progress."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P235072559" "Yes, sir.  I'll do that.  An Arachnos soldier, sir."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2595520099" "We're not alone!  Over and out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3548195591" "We've been discovered!  Out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARACHNOS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2894302214" "I have to go!  We've been discovered!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARTEMIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1230455457" "The Knives of Artemis don't give up information, no matter how seemingly persuasive the interrogator.  You're wasting your time."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P621780101" "Nothing yet, sir.  Artemis are not giving us anything useful."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2384823641" "Yes, sir.  I'll do what I can."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATEARTEMIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P139418652" "Plan B!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1504159530" "I am a soldier.  I am trained to withstand pain.  Your time is wasted."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3497558147" "I am a soldier.  You will get nothing from me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2383784653" "I cannot be intimidated.  I am a soldier."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P502627162" "I have nothing to say to you."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3591862762" "You'll pay for this, Corps!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2210044605" "You will rue the day, sir!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_CAUGHT_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2259341327" "You have not seen the last of me, I assure you!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_INTERROGATENEMESIS_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1794951185" "Yes, sir.  We're interrogating Nemesis now.  Yes, sir.  As soon as I have something.  Over."
