"P4112184878" "Great, another scumbag."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P571866584" "You want some too, eh?"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2576812731" "I consider this an opportunity."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4097290518" "Get ready for the pain."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1985402878" "Oh, I can't wait to hurt you."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P26465963" "You're a disgrace to the costume!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3695249330" "I'm taking you down!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P700296486" "You have the right to get face punched in."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3713944926" "I'm gonna knock you out!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1285866663" "Can't just let us duke it out can you?"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P912311081" "You're about to experience real pain."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4261268307" "Ooh, this is going to be sweet."
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1182562027" "Another punk?"
// MERCY_RUMBLEALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3734726514" "Guess what? You're going down."

// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P394477520" "Call in the helo - let's get these punks outta here."
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2487999855" "Another scumbag off the streets."
// MERCY_CAUGHTALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2687846616" "You're going to start talkin'."

// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2317549898" "I ain't talkin'."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2161564534" "Why don't you guys get lost?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1520182683" "Someone should put a stop to you guys."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3188170223" "Get outta my face."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558020270" "What you got against us?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3949950706" "It's not polite to point a gun."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2120668908" "You're gonna get yours."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P660795718" "How much will it cost to let us go?"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752187491" "You better watch your backs."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P285399490" "Get outta Mercy."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4104658728" "Mercy's ours!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P914062534" "I'm going to bet you end up in a shallow grave."

// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1783165861" "Hold 'em back, I'll get reinforcements!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P747416980" "I'll be right back!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4046789649" "Thanks for savin' my hide!"
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3668794008" "I'm not running, I'm regrouping."
// MERCY_CAUGHTVICTIMALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1781623063" "Teach him a lesson!"


// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3365624236" "What are you doing? Go back to Paragon City!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3906966331" "This ain't Paragon City, pal."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3817469985" "I'm not moving!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3563826164" "This isn't over."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4268993842" "I can bide my time..."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124708789" "When this is over...watch your back."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P252030774" "You're really making a mistake here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2429336929" "I can't believe you're doing this."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3706900297" "Get outta my city!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3067215144" "Arachnos is gonna tear you apart."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P279367504" "Saved by an interruption!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1043953018" "Sleep with one eye open."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1541961968" "I will see you very soon!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1804562814" "Now you're gonna get it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_THANKS_TEXT :
"P1030088390" "Thanks for the hand!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P19403334" "We're going to put you away, pal."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3078473809" "You've just won a nice room behind bars."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2061584665" "Tell us what we want to know and we'll go easy on you."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P907317557" "We're cleaning this place up."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P51211861" "Keep talking, scumbag."

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2696460425" "Forget these guys, we've got company!"

